# Folder hygiene (Split Smarter)

Follow [.llm/folder-hygiene.md](mdc:.llm/folder-hygiene.md) for all new or moved UI.

## Non-negotiables

- `app/` routes stay thin — import a screen entry; no business UI in routes.
- Product UI lives under `src/screens/{domain}/…` with private `components/`, `hooks/`, `types/` colocated.
- `src/components/` is **shared-only** (2+ screens). Never mirror a screen path under `src/components/` for private UI.
- Promote to shared only on second consumer (`common/`, `list-items/`, `skeletons/`, `empty-states/`, `modals/`, `global/`).
- Keep `src/api/` and `src/store/` global — do not bury axios clients inside screens.
- Folders: `kebab-case`. Screen entry: `index.tsx` (or re-export from it).
- No new `src/features/` or scratch roots. Playgrounds → `src/screens/dev/`.
- Extract large inline subcomponents to sibling files under the owning folder.

## Quick shape

```text
src/screens/{domain}/{screen}/
  index.tsx
  components/   # private
  hooks/        # private
app/...route.tsx  → imports the screen entry only
```
